cation — measured by\n  the published document reflecting the fixed behavior.\n- The product documentation accessibility statement is updated and republished\n  to reflect the fixed state — measured by the published statement.\n- Technical review is completed and recorded: a reviewer confirms each\n  conformance claim in the VPAT and accessibility statement matches the\n  implemented keyboard behavior of the audited flows — measured by a completed\n  review sign-off.\n- No conformance claim in the published documents asserts capabilities outside\n  the remediated scope (the four audited flows; keyboard operability and focus\n  indicators) — measured by a claim-by-claim check against the remediation\n  scope.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-3 (P2)**: The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product\n  docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed\n  state, with technical review — fully covered by this epic.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27738,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a33b1bf02ec03b87","agent_id":"a1c04fc6a0715eb2d","session_id":"d2f07c2f-aad3-43e7-a558-783e1249f639","uuid":"0167217d-74f1-4976-8e32-af7dd9776e0e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:28:48.818Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017"}
