tatement to reflect the fixed\n50\t  state.\n51\t- Republish both the VPAT and the accessibility statement at their official\n52\t  product locations.\n53\t- Ensure conformance claims are scoped accurately: claims cover the four\n54\t  remediated flows and do not assert keyboard operability for flows or controls\n55\t  outside them, and do not assert screen-reader conformance beyond what the\n56\t  keyboard fixes deliver.\n57\t- Obtain and record technical review of the updated documentation against the\n58\t  implemented behavior.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- The VPAT is updated to reflect the remediated state of the four audited flows\n63\t  and republished at the product's official conformance location — measured by\n64\t  the published document reflecting the fixed behavior.\n65\t- The product documentation accessibility statement is updated and republished\n66\t  to reflect the fixed state — measured by the published statement.\n67\t- Technical review is completed and recorded: a reviewer confirms each\n68\t  conformance claim in the VPAT and accessibility statement matches the\n69\t  implemented keyboard behavior of the audited flows — measured by a completed\n70\t  review sign-off.\n71\t- No conformance claim in the published documents asserts capabilities outside\n72\t  the remediated scope (the four audited flows; keyboard operability and focus\n73\t  indicators) — measured by a claim-by-claim check against the remediation\n74\t  scope.\n75\t\n76\t## HLR Traceability\n77\t\n78\t- **HLR-3 (P2)**: The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product\n79\t  docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed\n80\t  state, with technical review — fully covered by this epic.\n81\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b2a412fcc8a4d7c3","agent_id":"a7a602bd4af061252","session_id":"d2f07c2f-aad3-43e7-a558-783e1249f639","uuid":"cb198bee-9013-47f2-b3b1-4b18b27451e9","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:30:18.667Z","tool_r